d:\n\n1. **Invoice/QBO Swaps**: AWS and GCP amounts are swapped in QBO for Jan & Feb\n2. **Missing entries**: Comcast Feb missing from QBO, Blue Shield March missing from QBO\n3. **Extra entries**: Slack Jan in QBO but no invoice provided\n4. **Variance**: Salesforce April is $600 in QBO but $500 on invoice (no April invoice provided)\n\nNow I'll save the reconciliation results:", 'type': 'text'}, {'id': 'toolu_017LY2M6D9JE9U7hHUGZJzBP', 'input': {'reconciliation_json': '[\n  {"vendor": "Blue Shield of California", "period": "Jan 2025", "invoice_amount": 1200.00, "qbo_amount": 1200.00},\n  {"vendor": "Blue Shield of California", "period": "Feb 2025", "invoice_amount": 1200.00, "qbo_amount": 1200.00},\n  {"vendor": "Blue Shield of California", "period": "Mar 2025", "invoice_amount": 1200.00, "qbo_amount": 0.00},\n  {"vendor": "Comcast Business", "period": "Jan 2025", "invoice_amount": 189.00, "qbo_amount": 189.00},\n  {"vendor": "Comcast Business", "period": "Feb 2025", "invoice_amount": 189.00, "qbo_amount": 0.00},\n  {"vendor": "Comcast Business", "period": "Mar 2025", "invoice_amount": 189.00, "qbo_amount": 189.00},\n  {"vendor": "Google Cloud Platform", "period": "Jan 2025", "invoice_amount": 312.50, "qbo_amount": 987.45},\n  {"vendor": "Google Cloud Platform", "period": "Feb 2025", "invoice_amount": 425.00, "qbo_amount": 1262.32},\n  {"vendor": "Google Cloud Platform", "period": "Mar 2025", "invoice_amount": 198.75, "qbo_amount": 862.18},\n  {"vendor": "AWS", "period": "Jan 2025", "invoice_amount": 987.45, "qbo_amount": 312.50},\n  {"vendor": "AWS", "period": "Feb 2025", "invoice_amount": 1262.32, "qbo_amount": 350.00},\n  {"vendor": "AWS", "period": "Mar 2025", "invoice_amount": 862.18, "qbo_amount": 248.75},\n  {"vendor": "AWS", "period": "Apr 2025", "invoice_amount": 750.00, "qbo_amount": 750.00},\n  {"vendor": "Salesforce", "period": "Jan 2025", "invoice_amount": 500.00, "qbo_amount": 500.00},\n  {"vendor": "Salesforce", "period": "Feb 2025", "invoice_amount